@startuml
actor User
participant Frontend
participant Backend
database MariaDB

User -> Frontend : 평가 작성
Frontend -> Backend : POST /board (JWT)
Backend -> Backend : JWT 검증
Backend -> MariaDB : SELECT board WHERE user_id
alt 평가 존재
  Backend -> MariaDB : UPDATE board
else 평가 없음
  Backend -> MariaDB : INSERT board
end
Backend -> Frontend : 결과 반환
@enduml
